# The rake (GEAR.md G4): the pan rake's core set in the tool. A heavy, drawn,
# rakes the ground ahead and holds the biters in the arc open.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/rake.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=axe_works,mod_rake --held=axe_works
coast calm
place open_coast
wait 1.0
spawn cutter
spawn cutter
wait 0.5
try 6
walkto mob 1.5
hold swing
wait 0.34
release swing
await raked 0.6
end
shot 01-the-rake-drawn with mob:cutter
